          <p class="section-kicker">SELECTED WORK / 2024—26</p>
          <h2 id="work-title">Systems built<br />to <span>run.</span></h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="work-intro">
        <p>Infrastructure, delivery and reliability — from the network edge to the release pipeline.</p>
        
      </div>

      <div class="project-list">
        <a class="project-row" href="/work/progressive-delivery/" data-preview="/images/projects/progressive-delivery-platform.svg" aria-label="View Progressive Delivery Platform case study">
