          <span class="project-main"><span class="project-type">SERVERLESS / IDENTITY AUTOMATION</span><span class="project-name">Employee Onboarding &amp; Identity</span><span class="project-mobile-image" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/projects/employee-onboarding-service.svg" alt="" loading="lazy" /></span><span class="project-summary">An AWS onboarding system connecting employee identity, workflow orchestration and document handling.</span></span>
