            <span class="how-tag">ONE TASK</span>
          </article>
          <article class="how-step">
            <span class="how-index">02</span>
            <div class="how-step-copy">
              <h3>Give the agent one job</h3>
              <p>A narrow role, clear tools, and read-only access by default.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="how-tag">ONE JOB</span>
          </article>
          <article class="how-step">
            <span class="how-index">03</span>
            <div class="how-step-copy">
              <h3>Connect real tools</h3>
              <p>The agent works through AWS, Kubernetes, GitHub and Slack, not just through chat.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="how-tag">REAL TOOLS</span>
          </article>
          <article class="how-step">
            <span class="how-index">04</span>
            <div class="how-step-copy">
              <h3>Keep a human in charge</h3>
